# Vendored component registries.
#
# Installed by CLI (`shadcn-svelte add`, and the ai-elements registry — see
# components.json) and deliberately kept as upstream produces them so they can
# be re-synced. Reformatting them to this repo's style would put a permanent
# diff between us and upstream, and make every future `add` land with
# formatting noise on top of the actual change.
#
# These accounted for 526 of the 800 files failing `prettier --check`, which is
# why `npm run lint` had never passed repo-wide.
